  "status": "partial",
  "summary": "MSUI retains complete Party state and clears it only at the frozen leave/disconnect boundary while preserving it on worldport. Transfer pending/abort and login time-speed are now strictly decoded and applied through the loading curtain and server-owned world clock; the remaining broad session claims retain their existing verification status.",
  "openItems": [
    {
      "id": "item-claim-partyframe-invite-contract-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. Source-pinned runtime and deterministic checks implement the bounded invite popup, exact ordered effects, wire-body law, timeout, same-type override, direct-hide, and drag-off behavior.",
      "source": "claim-partyframe-invite-contract-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-partyframe-instances-driver-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. Source and deterministic parser, topology, and session checks implement full-roster retention, exact compact-slot derivation, four instances, atomic packets, leave reset, and world or session boundaries.",
      "source": "claim-partyframe-instances-driver-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-group-state-composer-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. Source-pinned handlers retain complete group metadata, full stats snapshots, and raid-target state, compose exact ordered system lines from packet notices and ungated roster diffs, and reset only at frozen leave/session boundaries.",
      "source": "claim-group-state-composer-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-login-stage-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI implements the equivalent observable login progression, failure surfacing, and connected transition in its own network client and glue screens.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-login-stage-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-character-management-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI handles SMSG_CHAR_CREATE/SMSG_CHAR_DELETE results and parses SMSG_CHAR_ENUM into its character select list.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-character-management-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-cinematic-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI handles SMSG_TRIGGER_CINEMATIC in its world session and net pump.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-cinematic-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-logout-complete-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI handles SMSG_LOGOUT_COMPLETE through its logout flow back to character select.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-logout-complete-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-mail-time-query-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI handles MSG_QUERY_NEXT_MAIL_TIME in its world session and net pump.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-mail-time-query-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-teleport-transfer-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI acknowledges teleports and applies pending transfers and new-world positions through its world session and net pump.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-teleport-transfer-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-transfer-aborted-gap-001",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "SMSG_TRANSFER_ABORTED is defined in the MSUI opcode table but never handled; aborted far transfers surface nothing.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-transfer-aborted-gap-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": true,
      "resolution": "2026-08-22: GameLoop dispatch strictly parses the abort reason, cancels the pending curtain/handoff, reports the refusal, and leaves an already adopted world load untouched."
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-time-speed-gap-001",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "SMSG_LOGIN_SETTIMESPEED is defined in the MSUI opcode table but never handled; server game time and speed are not applied.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-time-speed-gap-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": true,
      "resolution": "2026-08-22: GameLoop dispatch strictly parses packed datetime and timescale, applies the receive-stamped value to WorldClock, and the active atmosphere/GameTime consumers use it."
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-reputation-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI seeds factions from SMSG_INITIALIZE_FACTIONS and applies SMSG_SET_FACTION_STANDING updates in its net pump.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-reputation-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-claim-sessionrs-pong-001-verify",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": "Implemented but needs live-session verification. MSUI consumes SMSG_PONG in its network client keepalive.",
      "source": "claim-sessionrs-pong-001",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    }
  ],
